sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Filter as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant JwtUtil
    participant Ctx as SecurityContext
    participant Controller as VoyageController
    participant Service as VoyageService
    participant Repository as VoyageRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Client,DB: Representative authenticated request — GET /api/voyages/{id}

    Client->>Filter: GET /api/voyages/{id} (Authorization: Bearer JWT)
    Filter->>Filter: read Authorization header, strip "Bearer " prefix
    Filter->>JwtUtil: getUsernameFromToken(token)
    JwtUtil-->>Filter: username (or null if invalid)

    alt token valid (username != null)
        Filter->>JwtUtil: validateToken(token)
        JwtUtil-->>Filter: true
        Filter->>Ctx: setAuthentication(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken)
        Note over Ctx: SecurityContext now authenticated
        Filter->>Controller: filterChain.doFilter -> getVoyage(id)
        Controller->>Service: getVoyageById(id)
        Service->>Repository: findById(id)
        Repository->>DB: SELECT v FROM Voyage v WHERE v.id = :id
        DB-->>Repository: row(s)
        Repository-->>Service: Optional<Voyage>
        Service-->>Controller: Voyage (or throws RuntimeException if absent)
        alt voyage found
            Controller-->>Client: 200 OK + Voyage (JSON)
        else not found
            Controller-->>Client: 404 Not Found
        end
    else token missing / invalid
        Note over Filter,Ctx: SecurityContext stays anonymous, filter chain continues
        Filter->>Ctx: doFilter (no authentication set)
        Ctx-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden — anyRequest authenticated rejects
    end
